unsupported.wf:1:9: error: labelled inherit is not supported in Phase 0
  |
1 | inherit combat = /std/mixins/combat
  |         ^^^^^^
  = help: write `inherit /path/to/program`
unsupported.wf:2:1: error: `const` is not supported in the Phase 0 Weft subset
  |
2 | const MAX = 3
  | ^^^^^
  = help: use a `var` for now
unsupported.wf:3:1: error: `enum` is not supported in the Phase 0 Weft subset
  |
3 | enum Kind { A, B }
  | ^^^^
  = help: use strings or ints for now
unsupported.wf:4:1: error: `protected` is not supported in the Phase 0 Weft subset
  |
4 | protected var p: int = 1
  | ^^^^^^^^^
  = help: use the default (internal) visibility or `private`
unsupported.wf:7:5: error: `try` is not supported in the Phase 0 Weft subset
  |
7 |     try { g() } catch e { }
  |     ^^^
  = help: runtime errors abort the execution in Phase 0
unsupported.wf:9:13: error: closures are not supported in Phase 0
  |
9 |     let c = fn(x) => x + 1
  |             ^^
  = help: call a named function instead
unsupported.wf:10:8: error: objects have no fields; `field` must be called
   |
10 |     ob.field
   |        ^^^^^
   = help: write `.field()`
unsupported.wf:11:23: error: named arguments are not supported in Phase 0
   |
11 |     ob.tell_room("x", exclude: [me])
   |                       ^^^^^^^
   = help: pass arguments by position
unsupported.wf:12:8: error: `if let` is not supported in Phase 0
   |
12 |     if let o = ref { }
   |        ^^^
   = help: compare with null instead: `if x != null { … }`
